{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5001_p", "source_sha256": "8994d70a6b1619e6ef1cf637883b3b3e41d7175cdcd71ebf6e2a056d11434306", "ja": "（情報番組の撮影で、評判のお店にやってきた。\n女性に人気というだけあって、すごいオシャレだな）", "zh": "（为了拍摄资讯节目，我们来到了这家口碑很好的店。既然很受女性欢迎，果然非常时髦啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "030f164d8b19c25e2b753e2cf3e2f94cfc112817882b18c293dcfe3a8fd3f607", "ja": "わぁ……雰囲気があって、とっても素敵ですね！\nどんなお料理なんだろう？　楽しみだなぁ♪", "zh": "哇……氛围感十足，真是太棒了！\n会是什么样的料理呢？好期待啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5003_p", "source_sha256": "4866795ad517a942fe487515fbfbe417d7b92baf4ee3c3eb34aaa5ad9b1da667", "ja": "ビュッフェ形式らしいよ。種類の多さが人気らしい。\n風花の好きな料理を選んでいいってさ。", "zh": "听说是自助餐形式。好像是因为种类丰富而很受欢迎。\n还说可以选风花喜欢的料理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5f1966a9caeb57e484d49edceb12130106f1672bd19c06fe413b25eb1a3eba07", "ja": "そうなんですか？　好きに選べるのは嬉しいですけど、\nどれを選べばいいか迷っちゃいますね。", "zh": "这样啊？能自由选择确实很开心，可是该选哪一个好呢……有点犹豫了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5005_p", "source_sha256": "f5c850ed2dfcb5b5a05caf9461ebefdc7fcc44780ee21101bdc3d79d22d3e417", "ja": "そうだな。それなら……。", "zh": "是啊。那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5006", "source_sha256": "cb64b3e61f8ef184d8c3a0b774bf095037c70ee71f9fb7c8f0b5558824896491", "ja": "バエな料理", "zh": "上镜的料理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5007", "source_sha256": "7d57e864f71a82f5f30633f092ff73ba5a2a36711590a590a108b97360634444", "ja": "ヘルシーな料理", "zh": "健康料理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5200_p", "source_sha256": "24f2b321d31753b0a8d94d570441d93a684db06f9ecefb635d389edcdcb2e339", "ja": "ここはやっぱり、フォトジェニックでいこう！\n華やかな感じで、写真映えを狙うんだ。", "zh": "这里果然还是走上镜路线吧！\n弄得华丽一点，奔着能拍出好照片去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5201_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2e9cd73a92c5d812b7e6f1d344b62450c558f8636b8ae521dbb7d5e54661bcbb", "ja": "いいですね！　彩りが綺麗だったり、見た目が可愛いと\n誰かと共有したいなって思いますし。……あれ？", "zh": "很不错呢！要是色彩丰富、外观可爱的话，\n就会想要和别人分享呢。……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5202_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d4c69de9386d4c2c5f18c38c2dbf1e5bf95d2cd90c9ab44daeb1b4a79bdfb2a1", "ja": "それって、私の盛りつけにかかってるって\nことですよね！？　よ、よーしっ……頑張ってみます！", "zh": "这就是说，关键在于我的摆盘对吧！？好、好——……我会努力试试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5300_p", "source_sha256": "24f2b321d31753b0a8d94d570441d93a684db06f9ecefb635d389edcdcb2e339", "ja": "ここはやっぱり、フォトジェニックでいこう！\n華やかな感じで、写真映えを狙うんだ。", "zh": "这里果然还是走上镜路线吧！\n弄得华丽一点，奔着能拍出好照片去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5301_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5fc30278d9f64feff4856e2f6b6befe6baf24270c2d3d4976a92c2f645f0731a", "ja": "なるほど。オシャレなお料理を中心にしたら、\nちょっとだけ贅沢なランチになりますね！", "zh": "原来如此。以时髦的料理为主的话，\n就能变成稍微奢侈一点的午餐了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5302_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6de605a4f04f5561da12525de8caa0ca01f6ed32a1beb2d678e18707f137c24a", "ja": "私、お料理を見てきてもいいですか？　お腹も\n空きましたし……あ、も、もちろんお仕事ですけど！", "zh": "我可以去看看那些料理吗？肚子也有点饿了……啊，当、当然这是工作啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5500_p", "source_sha256": "ba7238794e3be9a67c3945e4f06460ce7f550a65d4610ff27015f40e44dccb11", "ja": "ヘルシーな料理を中心にしたらどうだろう？　\n栄養バランスを考えた取り方とか、参考になるような。", "zh": "以健康料理为主怎么样？\n比如考虑营养均衡的搭配方法，能给大家做个参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5501_041fuk", "source_sha256": "266bfc49c0fe26bce61a569fc86a2ef20c661b43cc1c99d6bd67328601613ff6", "ja": "そうですね！　そういうのは得意ですし。\n栄養もとれて、体にいいお料理を選んでみようかな。", "zh": "是啊！这方面我很擅长。\n要不我来挑些既能补充营养、又对身体有益的料理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5502_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8e83b435e8e1ab9b80eb75c193080bc69159e82bafe81f3043f90e0564a2321f", "ja": "{$P$}さんの分も選んでいいですか？\n体調管理も大事なお仕事、ですよね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "我可以帮{$P$}先生也选一份吗？\n管理好身体状态也是很重要的工作，对吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5600_p", "source_sha256": "ba7238794e3be9a67c3945e4f06460ce7f550a65d4610ff27015f40e44dccb11", "ja": "ヘルシーな料理を中心にしたらどうだろう？　\n栄養バランスを考えた取り方とか、参考になるような。", "zh": "以健康料理为主怎么样？\n比如考虑营养均衡的搭配方法，能给大家做个参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5601_041fuk", "source_sha256": "11c341c0a9f9290a1bceb445b78e77c7b046fc028621696f64acf72f2ea05973", "ja": "確かに、自由に選ぶと、栄養が偏っちゃうんですよね。\nそういうのって、すぐ体に出ちゃって……。", "zh": "确实，随便乱选的话，营养就会不均衡呢。\n这种情况很快就会反映在身体上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_5602_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6c8e74b64c1838e75db0ceebb745323a5ea0d1fa81bb2336af41f4e1cf2c6b18", "ja": "あっ、わ、私のことじゃありませんよ！？\n元看護師としての経験からで……ほ、本当ですよ？", "zh": "啊，不、不是在说我哦！？\n只是根据我以前当护士的经验……真、真的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
